  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "24",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr ni̱ni da̱ŋ dhieec cu bo̱o̱th palä in di̱i̱t ni A-na-ni-ath ben kɛnɛ tha̱a̱ŋ di̱tni ji̱ Juudh kɛ gua̱n ŋuɔ̱tni ni Ter-tä-läth. Cukɛ lukdiɛn kuëŋ nhiam mädhi̱i̱r kɛ kui̱ Puɔl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ca Puɔl cɔl, cu Ter-tä-läth jɛ tok kɛ mi gɔnyɛ jɛ, wëë i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ji̱n kuäär, kɛ pɛl bo̱thädu, ci kɔ nöŋ mal kɛ gua̱a̱th mi bäär, kä ci ti ŋuan rialikä, kɛ kui̱ döör ɛmɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mɛmɛ cakɔ jɛ nhɔk kɛ dup diaal, gua̱thni diaal kɛ tɛ̈th lɔaac mi di̱i̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ ɣöö /cä gua̱a̱th mi di̱i̱t bi naŋ kä ji̱, ɣän la̱ŋä ji̱ ɛn ɣöö bi kɔ liŋ kä mi tɔt kɛ kɔ̱a̱c lɔaacdu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ thuɔ̱k cakɔ wut ɛmɛ jek ɛn ɣöö ɛ gua̱n riirä mi di̱i̱t, kä ɛ ram mi gua̱n kuuthä nath rɛy ji̱ Juudh diaal wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n, kä ɛ bo̱o̱th bunä ji̱ Na-dha-rɛth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä jɛn cuɛ jɛ ɣɔ̱n bä ɛn ɣöö bɛ luaak Kuɔth ya̱r, kä cuakɔ jɛ käp. [Kä cuakɔ jɛ car ɛn ɣöö bakɔ jɛ luk ce̱tkɛ ciaaŋ ŋuɔ̱tnikɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö cu kuäär lathkëëri ni Li-thiäth jɛ ben naŋ kä kɔ kɛ buɔ̱m mi di̱i̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Li-thiäth wee bi gua̱n goo̱nyädɛ ben nhiamdu.]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24:6b-8a",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ɛn ka̱a̱th ti̱ti̱ matkɛ ni jɛ thi̱n ɛ tha̱a̱ŋ buɔkni tëë wal.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kä kɛ thiecnidu kɛ jɛ bi ji̱n puɔ̱nydu ŋɔaani diaal tin gɔanykɔ ni jɛ luäŋ kɛ ŋäc kä jɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ci ji̱ Juudh rɔ̱ mat kä gɔnydɛ, latkɛ jɛ ɛn ɣöö mɛmɛ kɛɛliw ɛ thuɔ̱k.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ga̱ŋ Puɔl kɛ rɔ nhiam Pi-lik",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci kuäär ɛ nyoth kɛ tetdɛ kɛ ɣöö bɛ ruac, cu Puɔl ɛ loc i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ɣän ŋa̱cä jɛ ɛn ɣöö kɛ run ti ŋuan cɛ ji̱n luuk rööl ɛmɛ, kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ tɛth lɔcdä kɛ ɣöö bä rɔ gaŋ nhiamdu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ce̱tkɛ mɔ bi jɛ jek ɔ, /cikɛ ni̱n ti ba̱lkɛ ni̱n wäl rɛw kɛn tëë wä kɛ ɣä pal kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /kenkɛ ɣä jek a gakä kɛ raan, kiɛ jakä naath kä rɔal rɛy luaak Kuɔth, kiɛ gua̱thni palä ji̱ Juudh, kiɛ rɛy wec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /cikɛ ji̱ dee nyuɔ̱th thuɔ̱k kä min gɔanykɛ ni ɣä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɣän bä ji̱ la̱t mɛmɛ, ɛ ɣöö palä Kuoth gua̱ndɔɔŋnikɔ ce̱tkɛ ciaŋ Duɔ̱ɔ̱p in cɔl kɛn ɛ i̱ kac, kä ɣän ŋa̱a̱thä ti diaal tin ca gɔ̱r rɛy ŋuɔ̱tni kɛnɛ ruaacni göökni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ta̱a̱ kɛ ŋa̱th rɛy Kuɔth, ɛn ɣöö ba ji̱ cuŋni kɛnɛ ji̱ dueeri jiɛc li̱th, ce̱tkɛ min ŋa̱thkɛ ɛ kɛn nɛy ti̱ti̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ la ɣɔ̱a̱nɛ jɛ ni ciaŋ ɛn ɣöö /cä bi tekɛ duer nhiam Kuɔth kɛnɛ nhiam nath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ mëë cä te jɔ̱ɔ̱r kɛ run, cua ben kɛ ɣöö bä do̱rä nöŋ yio̱w kɛnɛ ɣöö bä muc ben thöp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë la̱tdä mɛmɛ, cukɛ ɣä jek rɛy luaak Kuɔth kɛ kɔr kä min cä nyin leyä thuk, kä thilä buɔ̱n kiɛ wuɔ̱w. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö te tha̱a̱ŋ ji̱ Juudh ti bëë kä E-cia thi̱n deekɛ dhil ben nhiamdu wanɛ mɛ, kä deekɛ go̱o̱ny ben lat, mi tekɛ kɛ mi lökɛ kä ɣä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiɛ a wutni ti̱ti̱ pua̱nykiɛn latkɛ duerɔ ca jekɔ, mëë ta̱a̱ cuŋä nhiam ji̱ luɔ̱k, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ɛ ni mi ɛ riet kɛl ɛmɛ mëë cä yɔal mëë ta̱a̱ cuŋä nhiamdiɛn i̱, ‘Ɛ kui̱ jiecä nɛɛni ti ci li̱w, ɛn ɔ gɔanykɛ ni ɣä nhiamdu mɔ wa̱lɛ.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Pi-lik in ca la̱t Duɔ̱ɔ̱p ɛmɔ agɔaa luk ka̱p cuɔ̱ŋ a wëë i̱, “Mi wä Li-thiäth kuäär lathkëëri in di̱i̱t ben, bä lukdun ben ŋok.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kuäär lathkëëri in tɔt jiök ɛn ɣöö ba jɛ yien, kä bɛ te lɔrä kä mi tɔt, kä ba mäthnikɛ nhök ɣöö bikɛ tin go̱o̱rɛ lät kä jɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Puɔl nhiam Pi-lik kɛnɛ Di-ru-thi-la",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr ni̱ni cu Pi-lik ben kɛnɛ ciekdɛ ni Di-ru-thi-la mi la nya ji̱ Juudh. Kä cuɛ Puɔl jäkä raan, kä cuɛ jɛ liŋ mëë ruacɛ kɛ kui̱ ŋäthä kɛ Kritho Yecu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë cɛ ruac kɛ kui̱ cuŋni kɛnɛ ciaŋ in luäkni rɔ kɛnɛ luk in bi ben, cu Pi-lik dual, kä cuɛ wee i̱, “Jiɛyni ɛn, täämɛ. Kä mi wa̱a̱ wä tekɛ gua̱a̱th bä ji̱ cɔl.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn guäth ɛmɔ bä cuɛ ŋäth ni ɣöö ba jɛ moc yio̱w ɛ Puɔl. Kɛ kui̱ kä nɔmɔ cuɛ jɛ la cɔlɛ kä bɛ muɔɔŋ kɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kɔr kä mëë ci run da̱ŋ rɛw thuuk, cua gua̱a̱th Pi-lik guäl ɛ Por-ciäth Pɛth-täth. Kä cu Pi-lik Puɔl ba̱ny rɛy duëël yieenä kɛ ɣöö go̱o̱rɛ ɣöö ba jɛ nhɔk ɛ ji̱ Juudh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
